The Blood Spiral Base was built upon the original site of the [[Spiral Mark]], an magical sigil created by the [[Nullifier]] scout, [[Void]], to signal his brethren to come to Earth. {{Source|Words from Eathon}} After the Betrayer's attempts to bring back the Nullifiers were thwarted by the children of [[Lord Casterwill]], for centuries, the Base become home to the [[Blood Spiral]], where they waited in the shadows of history, slowly plotting their return. {{Source|The Divine Comedy}} A portal leading to the Base was set up in [[the Professor's castle]], through which [[Rassimov]] went to escape the Huntik team and fake his demise. He then reconvened with [[Wind]] and [[Shauna]], having set up the downfall of [[the Professor]]. {{source|The Divine Comedy}}

Rassimov would regularly wait in the Throne Room to receive orders from the spirit of [[the Betrayer]]. The [[Blooded Circle]] would also meet here to hear the Betrayer's designs and discuss the Spirals' next move. {{Source|Zhalia's Mission}} While the expansive training room would be used by the Spiral members to spar with each. [[Tantras]] would also train his new recruits in this room. {{Source|Boys Will Be Seekers}} 

On the longest night of the year, Rassimov invoked [[Void]] to activate the Spiral Mark, causing the ground of the base to break apart revealing the [[Spiral Mark]] beneath them. [[Zhalia Moon]], who had infiltrated the Blood Spiral, was then able to reveal the location to [[Dante Vale]] in a sketch using [[Logosbook]]. Dante then used [[Umbra]] to teleport himself and the rest of the team to the base to fight the Spirals. {{Source|Words from Eathon}} The [[Huntik Foundation]] and [[Casterwill family]] alliance also travelled to the base in the [[Scramjet]]s and waged a huge final battle  against the Blood Spiral. {{Source|The Spiral Mark}} During the battle between [[Harrison Fears|Harrison]] and [[Den Fears]], the throne room completely broke apart, with the Betrayer's throne rising up from the base and breaking out onto the surface. {{Source|Lok and the Betrayer}} Following the defeat of [[the Betrayer]], the Spiral Mark site and the surrounding base were kept under guard by the [[Huntik Foundation]]. {{source|Dante's Return}}

*The Throne Room - the main area in the base where the corpse of [[the Betrayer]] sits and gives orders directly to [[Rassimov]]. The members of the [[Blooded Circle]] convene here to receive orders, discuss the Betrayer's plans and devise the Blood Spiral's next moves. {{Source|Zhalia's Mission}}
*Training Area - This is a large cave where [[Tantras]] can train his new recruits and the [[Silent Soldiers]] can brutally spa against one another. {{Source|Boys Will Be Seekers}}
*Living Quarters - the Blood Spiral members live in small dormitories with simple beds, lit by candlelight. {{Source|Rassimov's Secret}}
{{Clear}}

